{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xyatmrz27z2ZCw2Z27hKte","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tid: 5edaa300-8c4d-49b6-85b3-0553e6846dfb\n3\tslug: lunar-module\n4\tname: \"Lunar module\"\n5\ttype: topic\n6\tdescription: \"Grumman two-stage lander: Eagle on Apollo 11, Aquarius served as Apollo 13's lifeboat\"\n7\tcreated: 2026-10-24\n8\tupdated: 2026-10-24\n9\taliases: [\"LM\", \"LEM\", \"lunar excursion module\"]\n10\t---\n11\t\n12\t## Facts\n13\t\n14\t- [stated] Two-stage lander built by Grumman (src: NASA history, 2026-10-24)\n15\t- [stated] Apollo 11's lunar module was Eagle (src: NASA Apollo 11 mission page, 2026-10-24)\n16\t- [stated] Apollo 13's lunar module Aquarius kept the crew alive after the oxygen tank failed (src: NASA Apollo 13 mission page, 2026-10-24)\n17\t- [stated] Its descent engine burn put Apollo 13 back on a free-return path (src: NASA Apollo 13 mission page, 2026-10-24)\n18\t\n19\t## Links\n20\t\n21\t- built by [[grumman]]\n22\t- flown on [[apollo-11]]\n23\t- saved [[apollo-13]]\n24\t- used [[free-return-trajectory]]\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6366cd1-22a8-4e9d-8360-b83caa0e931a","uuid":"05f41ee0-4ac2-4d2f-8165-f392ac0b5461","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:27:09.835Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\shman\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-shman-OneDrive-Desktop-Yggdrass-OS-Yggdrass-OS\\4def6ebb-4bae-4ed4-85d0-92ed32e7bd0c\\scratchpad\\exp7\\brain-B\\topics\\lunar-module.md","content":"---\nid: 5edaa300-8c4d-49b6-85b3-0553e6846dfb\nslug: lunar-module\nname: \"Lunar module\"\ntype: topic\ndescription: \"Grumman two-stage lander: Eagle on Apollo 11, Aquarius served as Apollo 13's lifeboat\"\ncreated: 2026-10-24\nupdated: 2026-10-24\naliases: [\"LM\", \"LEM\", \"lunar excursion module\"]\n---\n\n## Facts\n\n- [stated] Two-stage lander built by Grumman (src: NASA history, 2026-10-24)\n- [stated] Apollo 11's lunar module was Eagle (src: NASA Apollo